posts.text:
On the Senate Floor today, I urged my colleagues in Senate and House to pass the Stop Insider Trading Act.

@RepBryanSteil and I introduced this legislation to prevent insider trading by members of Congress.

We need to get this done to restore trust in our elected officials.

